</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>If non-zero, DEXT export creates one element for the entire DID described in the diagnostic instance.
Set this to simplify the port mapping (but the software component must unpack the element to get at the DID data).</TUV>
</DESC>
